			"notes": "# What's new?\n- Added Consumable Editor - allows for easy customisation of the Consumable component, it's in the Simple Editor.\n- Added Arrows Editor - allows for easy customisation of the arrows in a crossbow, can be set to any arrow type in the game and any arrow amount. It's in the Simple editor,\n- Added a \"Bundle Editor\" - basically a more advanced Container Editor, allows for infinite items inside a bundle, via the ClientChest GUI, now any bundle can have infinite items without the need for copy-pasting the raw NBT.\n- It's now possible to turn on and off the functionality of the Client Chest button on the left bottom corner, in case anyone has Erfs's NBTE fork.\n- Minor GUI changes."
		},
