			"notes": "### What's New?### \n\n- Client Chest - added a client chest with the exact style that the original NBT Editor had (no compatibility between them yet)\n- Villager GUI Editing - allows users to easily edit nbt via a fully vanilla-looking villager trade GUI with some other settings.\n- Made the Container Editor able to edit lecterns\n- Added a new \"Simple\" Editor mode, allows for quicker editing by adding on/off switches and one-number settings.\n- Enchanced the Skid Tool and fixed the bug of not being able to move items out of the Skid Items Screen\n_and some other misc tweaks..._\n\nThis time no 1.21.10 version this time because I don't have that much time, will be released in a different update."
		},
