			"notes": "New:\n- 1.21.10 Version support\n- Librarian Mod hotbar preloading on game start\n- Skid Tool - copies all files every player holds within the render distance to the SkidCache folder in the instance's directory\n- Smooth scrolling everywhere\n- Flawless Visual NBT Editor\n- Settings tab, allows for changing different.... _things_\n- Few other niche features\n_note, the 1.21.10 version may have bugs because of the fact it was ported from the 1.21.11 one (was downgraded), I am aware that the 1.21.10 one has bugged gui's._"
